OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court quashes decision to
OL,4,Arestrict annual Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe High Court has quashed a Parades
OL,7,FCommission decision to impose
OL,8,Frestrictions on the annual Orange Order
OL,9,Fparade at Drumcree in Portadown.
OL,11,FIt follows a legal challenge brought by
OL,12,Fa member of the Order.
OL,14,FThe commission had banned the July
OL,15,Fparade from entering the mainly
OL,16,Fnationalist Garvaghy Road - a move
OL,17,Fwhich reflected every decision it has
OL,18,Fmade since 1998.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
