OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court quashes decision to
OL,4,Arestrict annual Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 1998, the Parades Commission refused
OL,7,Fpermission for the Orange Order's march
OL,8,Fto go down Portadown's Garvaghy Road.
OL,9,FThis decision led to widespread
OL,10,Fdisorder in Portadown and across
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
